SUMMARY:Little Butt and Big Butt - 6.3 Mi\, 1700 Ft EG
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\n**Description**\nAnother higher el
 evation hike with a fun name and maybe we will see some fall colors. This 
 is on out and back for a total of 6.3 miles and 1700 ft of elevation gain.
  In the section from Little Butt to Point Misery Gap there are reportedly 
 365 wooden steps so be prepared for a leg workout. Some sections of the tr
 ail may be a bit overgrown so I suggest long pants and it sounds like it w
 ill be cold enough that you may want them and a jacket too.\n\nhttps://www
 .alltrails.com/explore/trail/us/north-carolina/big-butt-trail\n\n**CARPOOL
 **\nMeet at the Folk Art Center on the BRP at 8am. If you want to go direc
 tly to the trailhead\, please let me know and use the directions in AllTra
 ils. We will start at the Walker Knob Overlook at about 8:45 am unless we 
 get stuck behind the gravel trucks again.\n\n**WEATHER**\nThe weather curr
 ently looks good for Monday but I'll watch the weather and post a cancella
 tion message by 7:00 AM if there is a chance of severe weather or lightnin
 g during this time period..\n\n**QUESTIONS?**\nYou can message me through 
 MeetUp until 8:00 AM the day of. Cell reception may be sketchy\, but you c
 an try to text or call me up to the start of the hike: (508) 965-2333.\n\n
 **LEGALESE**\nThis Asheville Hiking Group event involves hiking and\, poss
 ibly\, transportation to and from the meetup site. Participants are respon
 sible for their own safety and affirm that they have the appropriate skill
 s\, physical conditioning\, equipment\, and supplies. Hiking may involve r
 isks to oneself and property. Neither your hike organizer nor Asheville Hi
 king Group can assure your safety nor eliminate all risks. Participants as
 sume full responsibility for any injuries\, damages\, or losses.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/316683936
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
